一、定义 / 1. Definitions
======================================================================

1.1 "本工程"指 ACFly Prophet 飞控工程仓库及其发布包中的全部内容。
"Project" means the ACFly Prophet flight controller repository and all contents of its release packages.

1.2 "闭源库"指本工程随附的 remoteid.lib、MeasurementSystem.lib 及其后续版本，以二进制形式提供。
"Closed-source Libraries" means remoteid.lib and MeasurementSystem.lib accompanying the Project, together with their subsequent versions, provided in binary form.

1.3 "商业用途"指以获取商业利益为目的，或用于商业经营活动的任何使用，包括但不限于：(a) 销售、出租、许可本软件或其衍生作品；(b) 将本软件的全部或部分集成、链接或打包进商业产品或服务；(c) 为客户提供基于本软件的技术服务、托管服务或 SaaS 服务；(d) 在商业组织内部用于其经营活动。
"Commercial Use" means any use for the purpose of obtaining commercial benefit or in the course of commercial business, including without limitation: (a) selling, renting or licensing the Software or its derivative works; (b) integrating, linking or packaging all or part of the Software into a commercial product or service; (c) providing technical services, hosting services or SaaS services to customers based on the Software; (d) use within a commercial organization for its business activities.

1.4 "非盈利用途"指不以获取商业利益为目的的教育、培训、学术研究、个人学习与业余爱好活动。
"Non-Commercial Use" means educational, training, academic research, personal learning and hobby activities not aimed at obtaining commercial benefit.

