4.1 闭源库以二进制形式随本工程提供，仅允许通过本工程公开的接口调用，且仅限非盈利用途。
The Closed-source Libraries are provided in binary form with the Project and may only be called through the public interfaces of the Project, and only for Non-Commercial Use.

4.2 禁止对闭源库进行逆向工程、反汇编、反编译、动态或静态分析破解、修改、拆分、再分发或创作衍生作品。
You may not reverse engineer, disassemble, decompile, crack by dynamic or static analysis, modify, split, redistribute or create derivative works of the Closed-source Libraries.

4.3 不得绕过、禁用或规避闭源库中的任何授权、激活、完整性校验或保护机制。
You may not bypass, disable or circumvent any licensing, activation, integrity verification or protection mechanism in the Closed-source Libraries.

4.4 闭源库的源代码不随本工程公开，本许可证不授予你获取其源代码的任何权利。
